- [ ] F1 Real-time detection with YOLO11n on `mps`, filtered by the profile's classes
- [ ] F2 Tracking with stable IDs (ByteTrack, `persist=True`)
- [ ] F3 Occlusion memory: keep a lost track for 1.5 s, predict its position, label it "hidden"
